Kernel patches: shared PE12/PE13 HW I2C + GPIO SMI on `&i2c2`.

Included in production `tp2bmc_defconfig` (`BR2_LINUX_KERNEL_PATCH`).  
Device tree: `sun8i-t113s-turing-pi2.dtsi` (`tpi-i2c-smi-arb` + `switch@smi`).  
Upgrade / upstream notes: `../KERNEL_UPGRADE_LOG.md`.

| Patch | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| 0001 | DT binding `turing,i2c-smi-arbiter` |
| 0002 | `tpi-i2c-smi-arbiter` driver + Kconfig |
| 0003 | `realtek-smi` bracket via `turing,smi-arbiter` |
| 0004 | Defer GPIO at probe; quiesce TWI before `smi_mode` |
| 0005 | Arbiter uses I²C platform device (`2502800.i2c`), not `i2c-0` |
| 0006 | Empty `smi_mode` pinctrl + per-xfer GPIO; `pm_runtime_suspend` |
